<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes have again hit Colombian army bases in the north, killing three soldiers and wounding dozens, while ELN guerrillas are extending their cocaine trafficking routes through Venezuela to Curaçao and the ABC islands. The ELN also announced plans to target corporate media in Colombia, and a house in Toro was entered by armed men who murdered three women. These actions show a widening of ELN operations beyond battlefield attacks to media intimidation and transnational drug networks. The conflict remains a low-intensity asymmetric war, with 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQOWNEdXlRQ2U1M3Z2aVgzLXk0S1ZPLWRrUi1qVkVEdUhZel9XamI2ZEg1X2VOZ3ZOMTRQYkw3ZW9nWGYzd3IzVlg2U01vblFSVTFOMnpCRk9UN2FfUGgwRjlaam95YWNIeWtsNTk0cVBfLWxtTmFXUlMwUHc5aVpYcTBaemZmaG8?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNRUxoTG83UlZ0blB4bjQzb1pGZzh3azlqN01nd0RXaVF3eFlXZ253U3V3RS1JaDMta2VYNkp0THdnYjhzQk1CUVo0b3Vsb1NoRXlncW5jTzBaOHBaOTFiMmVCamJnNWxCTVZwM2Rfcmp6WjZkNWREeHJuejhDY3U4SmJTRi1Kbm5WX0ZHY3BNNVNSbWVCWE5OUzE0bFhmaG1GWE1IOXV2V0l5YTFxamVBd05Saw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQZ24yVlA1TlJVLXRodVFEdk8tYTUwNzRYQUZNSzA4OHBXbEdfYjE3aFZ0U0xTeFA3aDBtY2dpTWhmRDNOeGNyUzBZMVN0ckl2eHRHTkhUMnhESDR6bXNocl9iLUFmaXA0T25tMEt3cnJWZ0xmcVFpOC1ja0RoLWhKNlNYamZGNUphQlQwU2ZPT3VsSW8wYnlfaEJJSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE4waDFHem9nMDlWQl80MWhYamJzRlJzQk9mOXpUNVlKOVB6VFlRSnc3b1ZNRGhVUEdvMlg3T3NfUFpWd2hmWVJyVjBkY3UtTTdhWmNVTHgzZTJtUFBxNDV2Nm9TSVNJaWx2ZjJ1a01NRGJLNmRXSGdZdHV30gF_QV